---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---
<PageLayout title="Terms & Conditions" description="Terms and conditions for purchasing research peptides from Peptides Source Hub.">
<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="container-narrow mx-auto px-4">
    <h1>Terms & Conditions</h1>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-gray-700">
      <div class="card"><h2 class="font-bold mb-2">Research Use Only</h2><p>All products sold by Peptides Source Hub are for laboratory research purposes only. They are not intended for human or veterinary diagnostic, therapeutic, or prophylactic use.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h2 class="font-bold mb-2">Ordering</h2><p>Prices are subject to change. Quotes are valid for 30 days. Orders are confirmed upon receipt of payment or purchase order acceptance.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h2 class="font-bold mb-2">Shipping</h2><p>Buyer is responsible for import duties and compliance with local regulations. Refer to our Shipping Policy for carrier and timeline details.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h2 class="font-bold mb-2">Limitation of Liability</h2><p>Peptides Source Hub shall not be liable for any damages arising from the use or misuse of our products outside their intended research purpose.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</PageLayout>
